{% set intro_content %}
<h2>Built for the lots you actually have</h2>
<p>North Shore properties tend to have opinions about what goes where. Steep grades, mature trees you can't remove, waterfront setbacks, access roads that weren't designed for delivery trucks. We've dealt with all of it.</p>
<p>We built the Gatherwell sauna at Ambleside Beach in West Vancouver. We've quoted residential builds from Deep Cove to Lions Bay. The properties are different from what we see in the rest of the metro area, and that's exactly why a site visit matters before we quote.</p>
<p>We're based in Squamish, about 40 minutes up the highway. We come to you, look at the space, and design for what's actually there.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set local_content %}
<h2>North Shore projects</h2>
<p>The Gatherwell sauna at Ambleside is a commercial unit you can visit. For residential, we work across both North Van and West Van.</p>
<p>The North Shore is also where we get the most questions about on-site builds. Some lots can't take a delivered unit. That's fine. <a href="/contact/" class="link--accent-underline">Tell us about your property</a> and we'll tell you what makes sense.</p>
